                                                "sense_id": "aff7c54a-4c39-32d4-ba94-3de1f7cc9031",
                                                "text": "\"Essentially,\" said a senior vice president of the FHLBB of Dallas, \"we were checkers of boxes.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "34fb46ac-7e48-37d7-802d-79f224a72b15",
